{"id":"6-1-2","courseId":"6","chapterNumber":"1.2","title":"Addisjon og subtraksjon av brøk","description":"Legge sammen og trekke fra brøker med lik og ulik nevner.","estimatedMinutes":45,"exercises":[],"competenceGoals":["beskrive og bruke plassverdisystemet for desimaltal, rekne med positive og negative heile tal, desimaltal, brøkar og prosent"],"content":[{"id":"6-1-2-intro","type":"text","content":"## Regning med brøker\n\nNår vi legger sammen eller trekker fra brøker, må vi vite om de har **lik** eller **ulik nevner**."},{"id":"6-1-2-lik-nevner","type":"definition","title":"Lik nevner","content":"Når brøkene har **lik nevner**, legger vi sammen tellerne:\n\n$$\\frac{2}{5} + \\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{2 + 1}{5} = \\frac{3}{5}$$\n\n$$\\frac{5}{8} - \\frac{3}{8} = \\frac{5 - 3}{8} = \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{1}{4}$$\n\n*Nevneren forblir den samme!*"},{"id":"6-1-2-ex-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-2-ex-1","number":"1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Regn ut (lik nevner)","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{7} + \\frac{3}{7}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{7}$"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{5}{9} + \\frac{2}{9}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{9}$"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{7}{10} - \\frac{3}{10}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{10} = \\frac{2}{5}$"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{11}{12} - \\frac{5}{12}$","solution":"$\\frac{6}{12} = \\frac{1}{2}$"}],"solution":"a) 5/7  b) 7/9  c) 2/5  d) 1/2","hints":["Legg sammen/trekk fra tellerne. Nevneren er uendret."]}},{"id":"6-1-2-ex-extra-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-2-ex-extra-1","number":"2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Regn ut (lik nevner)","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{7} + \\frac{3}{7}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{7}$","expressionAnswer":"5/7"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{5}{9} - \\frac{2}{9}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{9}$ (= $\\frac{1}{3}$)","expressionAnswer":"3/9"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{3}{10} + \\frac{4}{10}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{10}$","expressionAnswer":"7/10"},{"label":"d","task":"$1 - \\frac{2}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{5} - \\frac{2}{5} = \\frac{3}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"3/5"}],"solution":"a) 5/7, b) 3/9, c) 7/10, d) 3/5","hints":["Bare tellerne endres"]}},{"id":"6-1-2-ulik-nevner","type":"text","content":"## Ulik nevner\n\nNår brøkene har **ulik nevner**, må vi først finne **fellesnevner**:\n\n$$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{3}{6} + \\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{5}{6}$$"},{"id":"6-1-2-example-1","type":"example","title":"Eksempel: Addisjon med ulik nevner","problem":"Regn ut $\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{3}{4}$","solution":"**Løsning:**\n1. Finn fellesnevner: $3 \\cdot 4 = 12$\n2. Utvid begge brøkene:\n   - $\\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{2 \\cdot 4}{3 \\cdot 4} = \\frac{8}{12}$\n   - $\\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{3 \\cdot 3}{4 \\cdot 3} = \\frac{9}{12}$\n3. Legg sammen:\n   $$\\frac{8}{12} + \\frac{9}{12} = \\frac{17}{12} = 1\\frac{5}{12}$$\n\n**Svar:** $1\\frac{5}{12}$"},{"id":"6-1-2-ex-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-2-ex-2","number":"3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Regn ut (ulik nevner)","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{4}$"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6}$"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{3}{4} - \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{4}$"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{2}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{6}$"}],"solution":"a) 3/4  b) 5/6  c) 1/4  d) 1/6","hints":["Finn fellesnevner først, utvid brøkene, så regn ut"]}},{"id":"6-1-2-ex-extra-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-2-ex-extra-2","number":"4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Regn ut (ulik nevner)","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{2}{4} + \\frac{1}{4} = \\frac{3}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"3/4"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{6} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{5}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"5/6"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{3}{4} - \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{4} - \\frac{2}{4} = \\frac{1}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"1/4"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{6} + \\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{5}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"5/6"}],"solution":"a) 3/4, b) 5/6, c) 1/4, d) 5/6","hints":["Utvid til fellesnevner før du regner"]}},{"id":"6-1-2-ex-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-2-ex-3","number":"5","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Regn ut og forkort svaret","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{4} + \\frac{1}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{4}$"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{5}{8} - \\frac{1}{4} + \\frac{1}{2}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{8}$"}],"solution":"a) 3/4  b) 7/8","hints":["Finn en fellesnevner for alle brøkene"]}},{"id":"6-1-2-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Oppsummering\n\nI dette kapittelet har du lært:\n\n- **Lik nevner**: Legg sammen (eller trekk fra) tellerne. Nevneren beholdes: $\\frac{2}{7} + \\frac{3}{7} = \\frac{5}{7}$.\n- **Ulik nevner**: Finn fellesnevner først, utvid brøkene, og regn så med tellerne.\n- **Forkort svaret**: Sjekk alltid om svaret kan forkortes.\n\n### Husk!\n- Du kan ALDRI legge sammen nevnerne\n- $1$ kan skrives som $\\frac{4}{4}$, $\\frac{8}{8}$ — det du trenger\n- Fellesnevner først, regn etterpå"},{"id":"6-1-2-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Repetisjonsoppgaver","buttonText":"Vis repetisjonsoppgaver","content":[{"id":"6-1-2-rep-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-2-rep-ex-1","number":"R1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Regn ut (lik nevner)","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{6} + \\frac{4}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6}$","expressionAnswer":"5/6"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{7}{8} - \\frac{3}{8}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{8}$ (= $\\frac{1}{2}$)","expressionAnswer":"4/8"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{2}{9} + \\frac{5}{9}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{9}$","expressionAnswer":"7/9"},{"label":"d","task":"$1 - \\frac{3}{8}$","solution":"$\\frac{8}{8} - \\frac{3}{8} = \\frac{5}{8}$","expressionAnswer":"5/8"}],"solution":"a) 5/6, b) 4/8, c) 7/9, d) 5/8","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Tellerne regnes sammen, nevneren beholdes"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"6-1-2-rep-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-2-rep-ex-2","number":"R2","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Regn ut (ulik nevner)","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{6}$","solution":"$\\frac{3}{6} + \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{4}{6}$ (= $\\frac{2}{3}$)","expressionAnswer":"4/6"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{4}{12} + \\frac{3}{12} = \\frac{7}{12}$","expressionAnswer":"7/12"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{1}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{6} - \\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{3}{6}$ (= $\\frac{1}{2}$)","expressionAnswer":"3/6"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{3}{5} + \\frac{3}{10}$","solution":"$\\frac{6}{10} + \\frac{3}{10} = \\frac{9}{10}$","expressionAnswer":"9/10"}],"solution":"a) 4/6, b) 7/12, c) 3/6, d) 9/10","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Finn fellesnevner og utvid brøkene først"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"6-1-2-rep-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-2-rep-ex-3","number":"R3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Regn ut","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{3}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{8}{12} + \\frac{9}{12} = \\frac{17}{12}$","expressionAnswer":"17/12"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{7}{8} - \\frac{1}{4}$","solution":"$\\frac{7}{8} - \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{5}{8}$","expressionAnswer":"5/8"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{2}{5}$","solution":"$\\frac{5}{10} + \\frac{4}{10} = \\frac{9}{10}$","expressionAnswer":"9/10"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{11}{12} - \\frac{2}{3}$","solution":"$\\frac{11}{12} - \\frac{8}{12} = \\frac{3}{12}$ (= $\\frac{1}{4}$)","expressionAnswer":"3/12"}],"solution":"a) 17/12, b) 5/8, c) 9/10, d) 3/12","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Svaret kan bli mer enn 1 — det er helt greit"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"6-1-2-rep-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"6-1-2-rep-ex-4","number":"R4","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Brøk i hverdagen","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Du spiser $\\frac{1}{4}$ av en kake til lunsj og $\\frac{1}{8}$ til kvelds. Hvor mye har du spist til sammen?","solution":"$\\frac{2}{8} + \\frac{1}{8} = \\frac{3}{8}$","expressionAnswer":"3/8"},{"label":"b","task":"Hvor mye av kaken er igjen?","solution":"$1 - \\frac{3}{8} = \\frac{5}{8}$","expressionAnswer":"5/8"},{"label":"c","task":"Du blander $\\frac{1}{2}$ liter eplejuice og $\\frac{1}{3}$ liter appelsinjuice. Hvor mye juice får du (i liter)?","solution":"$\\frac{3}{6} + \\frac{2}{6} = \\frac{5}{6}$ liter","expressionAnswer":"5/6"},{"label":"d","task":"Du har gått $\\frac{3}{5}$ av skoleveien. Hvor stor del er igjen?","solution":"$1 - \\frac{3}{5} = \\frac{2}{5}$","expressionAnswer":"2/5"}],"solution":"a) 3/8, b) 5/8, c) 5/6 l, d) 2/5","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Hele kaken er 1 = 8/8"],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}}]}]}